	(text "Channel mapping (firmware table, D-19): AI1->AIN_6, AI2->AIN_7, AI3->AIN_0, AI4->AIN_1, AI5->AIN_2, AI6->AIN_3, AI7->AIN_4, AI8->AIN_5 (package order = planar fan-in from the link, no crossings). AI7/AI8 switch to the OPT chain with JP101/JP102 (default: SMA path)."
