	)
	(text "Input network per channel: 1 k series (limits clamp current to 36 mA at +-50 V), 1 nF to AGND (f-3dB ~160 kHz), BAV99 clamps to the +-12 V rails. ADC input +-10.24 V range, 1 MOhm input impedance, abs max +-20 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 19 0)
