	(text "ADS8688 decoupling per datasheet 11.1: AVDD 1 uF at each pin + 10 uF; REFCAP 1 uF + 22 uF (min 10 uF) direct at pins; REFIO 10 uF (internal 4.096 V ref, REFSEL low); DVDD 10 uF + 100 nF. DAISY = GND, RST/PD pulled to DVDD."
